{{2019 Australian federal election sidebar}}
In the leadup to the [[2019 Australian federal election|2019 federal election]], a number of polling companies have conducted regular [[Opinion poll|opinion polls]] for various news organisations. These polls collect data on party's primary vote, and contain an estimation of the [[two-party-preferred vote]]. They also ask questions about views of the electorate about the major party leaders.

